[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5083500511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121659#issuecomment-5083500511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121659","id":5083500511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLwAP3w","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T12:38:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T12:38:34Z","body":"> the debouce timer would go off during manipulation, causing a weird jump on the slider.\r\n\r\nHow to reproduce that? Moving the slider restarts the timer, so this doesn't sound possible.\r\nAlso the setting is set to the same value as slider, so it shouldn't jump either way.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5083500511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5084520223","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121659#issuecomment-5084520223","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121659","id":5084520223,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLw-fHw","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T17:08:46Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T17:08:46Z","body":"> > the debouce timer would go off during manipulation, causing a weird jump on the slider.\r\n> \r\n> How to reproduce that? Moving the slider restarts the timer, so this doesn't sound possible. Also the setting is set to the same value as slider, so it shouldn't jump either way.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0881eb4d-f417-441f-a5f7-7cfcda8b1311\r\n\r\nKind of hard to see here, but a jump happens at the beginning. Basically just do combinations of scrolling to zoom in/out and waiting, then trying again.\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nI was debugging this, and it seems this is the flow that happens:\r\n\r\nScroll mouse wheel which updates `thumbnail_size_setting` -> this causes `thumbnail_debounce_timer` to start then stop after 1.5s which causes `NOTIFICATION_EDITOR_SETTINGS_CHANGED` -> once in there, we can end up scrolling AGAIN before this block is evaluated:\r\n```c++\r\nint new_thumbnail_size_setting = EDITOR_GET(\"docks/filesystem/thumbnail_size\");\r\n\tif (new_thumbnail_size_setting != thumbnail_size_setting) {\r\n\t\tthumbnail_size_setting = new_thumbnail_size_setting;\r\n\t\tthumbnail_size_slider->set_value(thumbnail_size_setting);\r\n\t\tdo_redraw = true;\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n... which then causes the jump, because our `thumbnail_size_setting` is different from the editor setting that got set previously. Maybe there is a more clever way than the **thumbnail_debounce_timer->is_stopped())**?\r\n\r\n(I also added a check so scroll events weren't double in this PR.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5084520223/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5085169266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121659#issuecomment-5085169266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121659","id":5085169266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLxmGcg","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T20:03:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T20:03:49Z","body":"> once in there, we can end up scrolling AGAIN before this block is evaluated:\r\n\r\nYou have one frame window to do that, so it's not feasible unless the update causes the editor to freeze for a while (which is difficult to reproduce in this case).\r\n\r\nNot sure about the timer thing, but the other changes seem reasonable.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5085169266/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5336655268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121659#issuecomment-5336655268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121659","id":5336655268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPhblpA","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/even